# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Explicit negations. Stock Python/data-science .gitignore templates exclude
# *.pkl, model/ and data/ wholesale, which would silently drop the artifacts the
# assignment grades. These files MUST be committed.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
!model/
!model/*.joblib
!model/metadata.json
!test_data.csv
!data/*.csv
!data/*.json
!reports/
